but you don't want to tell me

00:11:38.510 --> 00:11:41.972
that I can take my own
career into my own hands

00:11:41.972 --> 00:11:43.925
and be an entrepreneur and come
up with something like this.

00:11:43.925 --> 00:11:45.619
They didn't teach you you could do this.

00:11:45.619 --> 00:11:46.565
- Yeah.

00:11:46.565 --> 00:11:50.300
- I'm just not, I'm not scared
man, I'm ready to step up

00:11:50.300 --> 00:11:52.828
and be a leader for this generation

00:11:52.828 --> 00:11:54.265
and be a voice for this generation

00:11:54.265 --> 00:11:56.562
and all these people can
act like they're talking for

00:11:56.562 --> 00:11:59.420
these kids, but it's just
an act, like I'm still one

00:11:59.420 --> 00:12:00.502
of those kids man.

00:12:00.502 --> 00:12:02.080
Like this means the world to me,

00:12:02.080 --> 00:12:03.774
and that's what this album is about.

00:12:03.774 --> 00:12:08.051
And I just know things
are going to change man.

00:12:08.051 --> 00:12:09.912
I feel it, I feel it.

00:12:09.912 --> 00:12:11.839
I believe in like, I dunno.

00:12:11.839 --> 00:12:14.179
- If you want to be a
fireman go and do it.

00:12:14.179 --> 00:12:15.387
If you want to be a ballet dancer then go

00:12:15.387 --> 00:12:16.926
and be a ballet dancer.

00:12:16.926 --> 00:12:18.074
If you don't believe in yourself,

00:12:18.074 --> 00:12:19.119
then no one else will believe in you.

00:12:19.119 --> 00:12:22.815
And yeah, it's so
important for me for people

00:12:22.815 --> 00:12:24.391
to understand that.

00:12:24.391 --> 00:12:25.973
That I want to be an inspiration.

00:12:25.973 --> 00:12:29.829
- I was bullied as kind of
nine out of 10 children are

00:12:29.829 --> 00:12:31.503
and I want to be a role model

00:12:31.503 --> 00:12:33.297
and I think now I'm in the
kind of lime light to go

00:12:33.297 --> 00:12:35.854
it's okay, and it's the
special people that are bullied

00:12:35.854 --> 00:12:36.687
ya know?

00:12:36.687 --> 00:12:38.130
The ones that have something magical

00:12:38.130 --> 00:12:40.815
and it's something that you
can turn into a positive

00:12:40.815 --> 00:12:42.981
and not let it eat you
away and they'll always

00:12:42.981 --> 00:12:44.722
be someone that says you can't do it.

00:12:44.722 --> 00:12:46.779
There'll always be someone that
says I don't believe in you.

00:12:46.779 --> 00:12:49.400
There'll always be someone
that says I do believe in you.

00:12:49.400 --> 00:12:51.180
There's always someone
that says you can do it.

00:12:51.180 --> 00:12:52.805
And that's the people
that you have to focus on.

00:12:52.805 --> 00:12:54.481
However much people try and put me down,

00:12:54.481 --> 00:12:56.015
which they do, when they say you know,

00:12:56.015 --> 00:12:57.681
every time I hear your song
I want to burn my ears,

00:12:57.681 --> 00:12:59.764
I say who's laughing now?

00:13:00.661 --> 00:13:04.603
- My name is Alex Parrish,
protecting our country

00:13:04.603 --> 00:13:07.310
had always been my dream.

00:13:07.310 --> 00:13:09.158
Quantico was my first audition.

00:13:09.158 --> 00:13:13.427
I knew I had to go into this
room and read these lines

00:13:13.427 --> 00:13:16.038
in front of all these
people, but I was so nervous

00:13:16.038 --> 00:13:17.570
before I went in.

00:13:17.570 --> 00:13:19.937
So I went to the bathroom, I
remember, before I went in.

00:13:19.937 --> 00:13:23.534
I looked in the mirror and
it's so stupid and cliche'

00:13:23.534 --> 00:13:26.452
but I talked to myself and I
said, what's wrong with you?

00:13:26.452 --> 00:13:29.033
You've played the most
difficult characters

00:13:29.033 --> 00:13:31.616
in the most complicated movies.

00:13:32.567 --> 00:13:36.734
Tossed my hair a little bit,
felt great and walked out,

00:13:37.776 --> 00:13:40.026
did my bit and got the job.

00:13:41.151 --> 00:13:42.925
- What's your message
for viewers out there

00:13:42.925 --> 00:13:44.384
about following their dreams?

00:13:44.384 --> 00:13:48.179
- I would say if you
truly believe in something

00:13:48.179 --> 00:13:49.777
and you really have a
passion for something,

00:13:49.777 --> 00:13:51.492
then go for it.

00:13:51.492 --> 00:13:53.529
I think there's a lot of
obstacles that you have

00:13:53.529 --> 00:13:56.520
to go through and nothing's
ever given to you.

00:13:56.520 --> 00:13:58.478
And it takes a lot of
hard work and dedication,

00:13:58.478 --> 00:13:59.685
but if you really believe in it,

00:13:59.685 --> 00:14:00.931
then you should do it.

00:14:00.931 --> 00:14:03.057
- And so you really have
to believe the internet's

00:14:03.057 --> 00:14:04.523
going to be mainstream.

00:14:04.523 --> 00:14:07.196
A lot of people are going
to get out there and use it.

00:14:07.196 --> 00:14:09.835
And that they're going
to be willing to pay

00:14:09.835 --> 00:14:11.239
for some content.

00:14:11.239 --> 00:14:14.471
- Is that the operating
idea that you have?

00:14:14.471 --> 00:14:17.467
- Well, each of these
businesses is an entrepreneurial

00:14:17.467 --> 00:14:21.020
business, the over
reaching theme is that yes,

00:14:21.020 --> 00:14:22.349
I believe in the internet.

00:14:22.349 --> 00:14:24.764
I believe it'll get increasingly popular

00:14:24.764 --> 00:14:27.205
and we're doing some neat
new things to take advantage

00:14:27.205 --> 00:14:28.038
of that.

00:14:28.038 --> 00:14:31.385
- You've got a lot of cash on hand, yes?

00:14:31.385 --> 00:14:32.218
- Right.

00:14:32.218 --> 00:14:33.836
- All right. (laughs)

00:14:33.836 --> 00:14:35.441
And it puts you in an enviable position.

00:14:35.441 --> 00:14:37.618
You can experiment with a
lot of entrepreneurial ideas

00:14:37.618 --> 00:14:40.918
and see what sticks and what flies.

00:14:40.918 --> 00:14:43.432
- Well, we're in business
to make money and,

00:14:43.432 --> 00:14:47.505
- But the other thing is providing
such a cash flow for you.

00:14:47.505 --> 00:14:49.699
- Well, it all belongs
to the shareholders.

00:14:49.699 --> 00:14:51.363
We're not dilatants.
- No, I know.

00:14:51.363 --> 00:14:52.973
- We are business people.

00:14:52.973 --> 00:14:56.980
And it is true that if you find an idea

00:14:56.980 --> 00:15:00.062
that requires three or
four years of improvement

00:15:00.062 --> 00:15:02.684
and patience and really sticking with it,

00:15:02.684 --> 00:15:04.746
that we're very good at that.

00:15:04.746 --> 00:15:07.286
Take Windows, which we bet our company on.

00:15:07.286 --> 00:15:09.286
Everybody who doubted that would succeed,

00:15:09.286 --> 00:15:11.851
IBM did not support us in that.

00:15:11.851 --> 00:15:14.437
It took longer than we expected.

00:15:14.437 --> 00:15:17.249
Over four years before
finally graphical interface

00:15:17.249 --> 00:15:19.887
got popular and now people
take it for granted.

00:15:19.887 --> 00:15:21.387
It's part of every personal computer

00:15:21.387 --> 00:15:23.844
and you just expect it to be there.

00:15:23.844 --> 00:15:27.036
That was one of the grand
successes of the company.

00:15:27.036 --> 00:15:29.226
In the same way, we're
betting on the internet.

00:15:29.226 --> 00:15:31.405
That our tools there
will be popular and that

00:15:31.405 --> 00:15:34.635
a few of these content
plays that we've decided

00:15:34.635 --> 00:15:38.097
to get involved in, that
the scale and the users

00:15:38.097 --> 00:15:40.864
will make those into great businesses.

00:15:40.864 --> 00:15:42.223
- Thank you guys so much for watching.

00:15:42.223 --> 00:15:44.280
I'd love to know what did
you think of this video.

00:15:44.280 --> 00:15:46.533
Which clip resonated the
most wit you and why.

00:15:46.533 --> 00:15:49.008
Also is there anything
that you want to share

00:15:49.008 --> 00:15:50.711
about the power of belief
that will help the other

00:15:50.711 --> 00:15:52.425
members of Believe Nation.

00:15:52.425 --> 00:15:53.626
Leave it down in the comments below

00:15:53.626 --> 00:15:55.332
and I'm going to join in the discussion.

00:15:55.332 --> 00:15:57.681
I also want to give a quick
shout out to Jerry Crawford,

00:15:57.681 --> 00:15:59.879
Jerry thank you so much
for picking up a copy

00:15:59.879 --> 00:16:02.196
of my book, Your One Word,
it really really really

00:16:02.196 --> 00:16:04.414
means a lot to me and I
hope you're enjoying it.

00:16:04.414 --> 00:16:05.665
Sot thank you guys again for watching.

00:16:05.665 --> 00:16:07.956
I believe in you, I hope
you continue to believe

00:16:07.956 --> 00:16:10.681
in yourself and whatever your one word is,

00:16:10.681 --> 00:16:13.181
much love, I'll see you soon.

